            "review_title": "Review at Nasi Padang Restaurant",
            "review_text": "eileent3821\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia\n0\nAUTHENTIC NASI PADANG IN HO CHI MINH\nNov 2022\nNasi Padang, which comprises rice with side dishes, originated in the West Sumatran city of Padang. Hence its name. But it is also becoming a big part of the Vietnamese food scene. Just walk in and get a plate of rice and choose any dishes or food. There are different sorts of mouth-watering dishes on display. The difficulty is in choosing what to leave out rather than what to order. You will be charged on the amount of food on your plate. The price is reasonable & the restaurant is very clean. Open daily and be there early to avoid the rush hour. Beef Rendang and Black Ink Squid was delicious!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 21, 2022",
